    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "S21S4",
      "x": 8857,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "KTV人格宇宙 / 皮肤体系优化 v3",
      "width": 2600,
      "height": 3900,
      "fill": "#070711",
      "cornerRadius": 18,
      "stroke": "#FFE85B",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "layout": "none",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "hn1Pm",
          "x": 42,
          "y": 38,
          "name": "v3标题",
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1900,
          "content": "KTV人格宇宙 · 皮肤体系优化 v3",
          "lineHeight": 1.18,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 50,
          "fontWeight": "900"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Q9bpF",
          "x": 42,
          "y": 108,
          "name": "v3说明",
          "fill": "#9EF7FF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 2300,
          "content": "目标：每个人格的皮肤必须围绕同一个人格做三种状态，不能复用其他人格卡面，也不能只是同一人换颜色。每张皮肤后续都按这里的方向重新生成。",
          "lineHeight": 1.18,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "dtbpY",
          "x": 42,
          "y": 178,
          "name": "v3规则标题",
          "fill": "#FFE85B",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 600,
          "content": "设计规则",
          "lineHeight": 1.18,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 30,
          "fontWeight": "900"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "C68pOR",
          "x": 42,
          "y": 226,
          "name": "v3规则正文",
          "fill": "#DCE6FF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 2300,
          "content": "1. 基础形象一致：同一人格要看得出是同一个IP角色。  2. 状态差异明显：服装、道具、表情、场景都要变。  3. 人格语义清楚：LOVER要像唱情歌的人，JOKER要像自嘲伤心的人，BOSS要像控台的人。  4. 默认皮肤用于结果页，第二/第三皮肤用于收集和复玩。",
          "lineHeight": 1.18,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
